ub.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":27,"created_at":"2026-01-27T16:02:52Z","updated_at":"2026-08-22T18:48:58Z","closed_at":"2026-02-04T00:09:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.6.0.stable.mono (Windows 11) (`v4.6.stable.mono.official [89cea1439]`)\n- Not found in Godot 4.5.1.stable.mono (Windows 11).\n\nAfter upgrading to `Godot 4.6.0.stable.mono (Windows 11)` I've been getting **frequent crashes** when building and running my game.\n\nI haven't been able to find any open/closed issues on this, and this is my first Godot C# project, so this could be something I haven't seen before (but others have).\n\n<img width=\"1395\" height=\"161\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c14f3608-de66-4d9a-be4f-1cf193e68e33\" />\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - AMD Ryzen 7 7700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.14 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen running my game in Godot (the application build completes correctly in my code editor with `dotnet clean && dotnet build`), I will occasionally get a crash (this has happened maybe 5 times in as many hours).\n\nThis output in the code usually indicates the game is about to crash and close out the Godot editor, but not always.\n\n<img width=\"1395\" height=\"161\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a41b18a0-df97-475a-bd4d-f1e510ade74a\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI don't know why this error occurs or what can reproduce it, as it appears to be intermittent. \nI do have UI dialogs (confirmation/accept dialogs), but I'm not sure if that message of: `editor/gui/progress_dialog.cpp` refers to those UI elemtents.\n\nNote: I haven't written any custom C++ code, so this is likely coming from Godot's core?\n\n## TEMPORARY WORKAROUND:\n\nFor those looking for a workaround for this until a full release comes, @akien-mga has kindly created a stable build:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115460#issuecomment-3834523678\n```\nI've made a test build of 4.6-stable + https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106299 reverted, for Windows, macOS and Linux editors:\nhttps://github.com/akien-mga/godot/releases/tag/4.6-stable-fix-115460\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115460/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"ti